{"ref":"BDB, בַּ֫עַר","hw":"בַּ֫עַר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בַּ֫עַר</span></big>  <strong>n.m. brutishness</strong> (only poet.)—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:11\" href=\"/Psalms.49.11\">ψ 49:11</a> + 3 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּ֑עַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.1\">Pr 12:1</a>;—in combination, <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ־ב׳</span> <em>brutish man</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:7\" href=\"/Psalms.92.7\">ψ 92:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כסיל</span>); elsewhere <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳</span> alone in same sense (concrete) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:11\" href=\"/Psalms.49.11\">ψ 49:11</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>), & as pred. = adj., <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:22\" href=\"/Psalms.73.22\">ψ 73:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.1\">Pr 12:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.2\">30:2</a>.","next":"BDB, בַּעֲרָא","prev":"BDB, בָּעַר²"}